### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###

### Create a deposit
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### Create a transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### Create a withdrawal
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

###

### List all transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions

###

### Filter by account
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

###

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions?type=transfer

###

### Filter by date range
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31

###

### Combine filters
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=deposit

###

### Get transaction by ID (replace with a real ID from POST response)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/replace-with-real-id

###

### Get account balance
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

###

### Get account summary
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

###

### Validation error example
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "INVALID",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -10,
  "currency": "FAKE",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###
